 number. For example, we have $2\\text{i}\\in C$ but $2\\text{i}\\notin Z.$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395728 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395729 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395728 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395730 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395728 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395731 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395728 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395732 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395728 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395733 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395728 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395728 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395728 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395733 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395728 1080 #uuid "2de47cf9-4ba6-564d-8b13-dc2ae4c1b836" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395729 1081 "R⊆R" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395729 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395729 1084 #uuid "6bd69dee-1a90-5731-909e-bf193606c3f1" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395730 1081 "Q⊆R" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395730 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395730 1084 #uuid "ef9e9860-9681-5612-8906-739b929d5dd1" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395731 1081 "{Z}^{+}⊆Z" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395731 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395731 1084 #uuid "326b432e-d3d4-56b8-9641-51af48c34b1e" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395732 1081 "Z⊆R" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395732 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395732 1084 #uuid "1d8512ed-f553-5147-af6d-509a075c0b1e" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395733 1081 "C⊆Z" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395733 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395733 1084 #uuid "0d38cc69-4692-5308-aef1-5edd65a60ef8" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395734 1068 #edb/ref 17592186395735 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395734 1069 "q-12498" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395734 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395734 1071 "$\\int \\sqrt{5x+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395734 1072 #uuid "457b9ae0-36a8-577c-85ad-8057dc66fc9a" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395734 1074 "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (5x+1)^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNow, we let $u=5x+1.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5x+1)^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{1/2}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\int {u}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}{u}^{3/2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}{u}^{3/2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}(5x+1)^{3/2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{2}{15}\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}+C] & =\\frac{2}{15}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(5x+1)^{3/2}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}(5x+1)^{1/2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5x+1)+0 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}(5x+1)^{1/2}\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =(5x+1)^{1/2} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5x+1}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395735 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395736 13194139533466 1759218604558