 $2$nd one), so ${x}_{3}$ is a free variable. From the  second equation we get ${x}_{2}=0$ and then from the first equation we obtain  ${x}_{1}=-{x}_{3}.$ So, any vector in ${H}^{⊥}$ has the form \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $B={[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}$ is a basis of ${H}^{⊥}.$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395906 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395907 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395908 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395909 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395910 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395905 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395905 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395905 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395909 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395905 1080 #uuid "d6e41552-50f9-524e-afed-203ff9c4cd4e" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395906 1081 "B={[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395906 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395906 1084 #uuid "efe5e0de-876b-5327-9906-468b6bb4ce4e" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395907 1081 "B={[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395907 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395907 1084 #uuid "d6b5c424-dcd8-543b-8f0d-5fef2732067d" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395908 1081 "B={[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395908 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [1759