ligned}\\frac{4}{15} & =\\frac{2}{3}(1)^{3/2}-\\frac{2}{5}(1)^{5/2}+C \\\\ \\frac{4}{15} & =\\frac{2}{3}-\\frac{2}{5}+C \\\\ \\frac{4}{15} & =\\frac{4}{15}+C \\\\ C & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the velocity $v$ of the particle at time $t$ is $v(t)=\\frac{2}{3}{t}^{3/2}-\\frac{2}{5}{t}^{5/2}.$\n\nNow, we find the moments in time when $v=0\\,\\text{m}/\\text{s}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3}{t}^{3/2}-\\frac{2}{5}{t}^{5/2}=0 \\\\ \\frac{2}{5}{t}^{3/2}(\\frac{5}{3}-t) & =0 \\\\ t & =0,\\,\\frac{5}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $t>0$, the particle is stationary when $t=\\frac{5}{3}\\,\\text{s}.$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395939 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395940 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395941 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395942 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395943 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395938 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395938 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395938 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395942 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395938 1080 #uuid "fead9c5f-966c-5594-b2e5-c190cdcde2f5" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1081 "t=\\frac{3}{5}\\,\\text{s}" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1084 #uuid "7b7ecb47-348a-575c-b016-4544f1974784" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395940 1081 "t=\\frac{1}{15}\\,\\text{s}" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395940 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395940 1084 #uuid "b7e2897f-2d72-56a4-bcc5-a06d675b471f" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395941 1081 "t=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{s}" 13194139533466 175921